CodeSystem: KenyaLabLocalCodeSystem
Id: kenya-lab-local-codes
Title: "Kenya Local Lab CodeSystem"
Description: "Locally hosted laboratory terminology used for validation in environments where direct LOINC terminology resolution is unavailable. The code values mirror selected LOINC identifiers to preserve interoperability intent."
* ^status = #active
* ^experimental = false
* ^caseSensitive = true
* ^content = #complete
* #58410-2 "CBC panel - Blood by Automated count" "Locally hosted mirror of LOINC 58410-2 for complete blood count panel reporting."
* #718-7 "Hemoglobin [Mass/volume] in Blood" "Locally hosted mirror of LOINC 718-7 for hemoglobin result reporting."
